// AWS IAM User Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1136.003
// Detects creation of a new IAM user (CreateUser). Adversaries create users to maintain persistent access independent of compromised…
// False positives: Provisioning of new service or human users by identity/platform teams.
// Source: rules/persistence/iam-create-user.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateUser$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i
